build/
st80
*.o
*.a
*.d

# The MSVC build's leavings.  st80 above does not cover st80.exe, and
# *.o does not cover *.obj.  *.pdb is the debug database; *.ilk is the
# incremental-link record.  See Windows.md.
st80.exe
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk

# The Xerox Smalltalk-80 virtual image, its sources, and the Xerox reference
# execution traces.  These carry no license grant from any host -- not
# Wolczko's site, not the archive.org mirror.  They are used here as a
# private development oracle only and must never be committed or
# redistributed.  See doc/LICENSING.md.
oracle/

# The bootstrapped image is a build product.
*.image
*.changes

# And so is a snapshot taken from inside the desktop.  SystemDictionary>>
# snapshotAs: writes prefix , '.im', and the prefix is whatever was typed at
# the save prompt -- so the glob, not snapshot.im, which is only the default
# the prompt offers.
*.im

# Screenshots of the Xerox image reproduce its content, which carries the
# same absent license grant as the image itself.  See doc/LICENSING.md.
smalltalk-desktop.*
screen*.pbm

# -screenshot writes the antialiasing coverage plane beside the .pbm, so the
# window's own output can be checked without a window.  Same reasoning.
screen*.cov

# Rendered copies of documents whose source is already tracked.  The Markdown
# under doc/ is the original; a PDF of it is a second copy to keep in step
# and no reader of this repository needs one.
*.pdf

# LaTeX intermediates from manual/.  The .tex is the source and the PDF is
# already excluded above; these are neither.
manual/*.aux
manual/*.log
manual/*.out
manual/*.toc
manual/chapters/*.aux
manual/__pycache__/

# The fixture lib/Database-Live-Tests makes and empties.  It is a build
# product of running that suite -- the tests recreate its tables on every
# setUp -- and SQLite's rollback journal beside it is one too.
st80-dblive-test.db
st80-dblive-test.db-journal
st80-odbc-parallel-test.db
st80-odbc-parallel-test.db-journal
st80-rest-live-test.db
st80-rest-live-test.db-journal

# Code-RAG local index files (written by bld; machine-local, not part of the project)
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.local.md
